"P1792295872" "<i>I want to thank you for being so helpful and kind when dealing with me. I know Dr. Keyes trusts you all and that means a lot to me.<br><br>Anyway, happy Valentine's Day, and, I know you don't normally date girls like me, but if you are interested, ask me out sometime.<br>-Valerie</i><br><br>Sounds like Rick Davies has got a hot date with Valerie Kellum, the nanite infused super heroine known as Valkyrie. Of course, nothing on here suggests that it is for Rick other than you knowing that D.A.T.A. has been working with Valkyrie to study her nanotechnology, but you know that Valerie is just the type of girl Tony Kord would like to get to know better, if only so he could have a look at what makes her powers tick."
